# Seeded with the Lamplight fixture. Playing by the palette and the keys:
# a verb that asks which thing, cancelling it, typing it instead, tapping a
# word on the page, a reply the story refuses, Again, and the library as a
# detour that keeps the story where it was.
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for light.
expect Look
expect Inventory
expect North
# Lamplight has no undo, so the palette does not offer one.
expect-missing Undo
tap Open
wait-for Open what?
expect Wooden crate
expect Type it
tap Cancel
expect-missing Open what?
# Back puts the question away before it leaves the story.
tap Open
wait-for Open what?
tap-id 4294967295
expect-missing Open what?
expect Lamplight
tap Open
tap Wooden crate
wait-for revealing a folded note.
clean
shot play-opened
# Type it opens the keys with the verb already there.
tap Take
wait-for Take what?
tap Type it
expect Close keys
expect take
type note
tap Run
wait-for Taken.
tap Close keys
tap Inventory
wait-for carrying a folded note.
tap Again
wait-for > again
expect carrying a folded note.
clean
shot play-again
# A word the story does not know is answered by the story itself.
tap Keyboard
type xyzzy
tap Run
wait-for not a verb I recognize.
clean
shot play-unknown-verb
# A word tapped on the page joins the command being typed. Only words the
# story knows are links, so "crate" is the third after "look" and "wooden".
tap Close keys
tap Look
wait-for pool of light.
tap-id noun-2
expect Close keys
expect crate
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type examine note
tap Run
wait-for A note folded small
tap Close keys
# The library is a detour: the open story is where it was.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Interactive fiction
tap Lamplight
wait-for A note folded small
expect-missing Starting story
# The thing a reply reveals is offered to the next verb.
tap Keyboard
type put note in crate
tap Run
wait-for into the wooden crate
type close crate
tap Run
wait-for You close the wooden crate.
tap Close keys
tap Look
wait-for pool of light.
tap Open
wait-for Open what?
tap Wooden crate
wait-for revealing a folded note.
clean
shot play-reopened
tap Read
wait-for Read what?
expect Folded note
tap Folded note
wait-for A note folded small
